sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Browser
    participant Traefik as Traefik Ingress (:443)
    participant Auth as Authentik Embedded Outpost
    participant App as Target App (e.g. Open WebUI)

    User->>Traefik: GET / (with session cookie)
    Traefik->>Auth: Forward-Auth Check (GET /outpost.goauthentik.io/auth/traefik)
    alt Authenticated & Authorized (Group Member)
        Auth-->>Traefik: HTTP 200 OK (X-authentik-username: user)
        Traefik->>App: Upstream Proxy Request (with identity headers)
        App-->>Traefik: HTTP 200 OK Response
        Traefik-->>User: HTTP 200 OK Delivery
    else Unauthenticated
        Auth-->>Traefik: HTTP 401 / 302 Redirect
        Traefik-->>User: HTTP 302 Redirect to Authentik Login Flow
    end
